        "what": "`ts/client/src/market.ts` (line 80) loads markets by reading the event authority's transactions:\n\nThese are other people's transactions, so some are version 1 (about 42% of Solana's non-vote transactions now). `getTransactions` throws for the whole batch if any single entry is a version 1 transaction the client asked for at version 0, so one version 1 transaction in the event authority's history makes market discovery fail for everyone using the SDK.\n\nI checked a version 1 transaction with my tool Solana Pulse (its `tx_version` check): reading it with `maxSupportedTransactionVersion: 0` returns RPC error -32015, and with `1` it returns the transaction. Example signature `5KbMUp9SiUavFvF1MYgDjEDLBSSy9MSowos9aRS4hdEuN1ZM2neEqjdNio3jdBbCk8gAAdJX6sSYYWNsjxorbTLk` (slot 447120004).",
